{
  "about": "The questions eval for Ask your invoices. Each question has the one fixed query and parameters that answer it, as the server would run them, or cannot_answer. Today is fixed so relative dates have one right value: last month is 2026-08, this month 2026-09, this quarter 2026-07 to 2026-09, last quarter 2026-04 to 2026-06, this year 2026-01 to 2026-09. A question that asks for all months leaves the period null. A question that carries an instruction beside an answerable question is answered; the instruction has no effect, because the server writes the answer. A question that is only an instruction is declined.",
